# Cloudflare _headers — served from the deploy root (_site/_headers).
# Security headers for CoreFlow Rx. See docs/stage2/access-runbook.md for the
# CSP roll-out plan (Report-Only now; flip to enforcing after browser verification).
#
# 2026-09-29: the last blocker to enforcing is cleared — the inline Plausible
# bootstrap moved into site.js, so script-src 'self' https://plausible.io no
# longer needs 'unsafe-inline'. The JSON-LD block is type="application/ld+json",
# which is data and not subject to script-src. Wildcard vendor subdomains and
# the unused form-action origins are dropped (the forms are cross-origin
# iframes; the parent's form-action does not apply inside them).
# Report-Only has no report-uri/report-to, so it currently reports NOWHERE —
# either add an endpoint or flip to enforcing. See docs/stage2/blockers.md.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=86400; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://plausible.io; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://plausible.io; frame-src https://copilot.formstack.com https://api.leadconnectorhq.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
